# Legion Extruder: "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice another artifact: Create a 3/3 colorless Golem artifact creature token." The
# artifact must be another one (not the Extruder) and one its controller controls (CR 118.1, 701.17): on turn 3 the only
# other artifact is Bot2's Sol Ring, so the ability is not offered; on turn 5, with Bot1's own Mox Ruby (the positive
# control), it makes a Golem; the tapped Extruder offers it no second time that turn; and on turn 7 the Golem token itself,
# an artifact, is sacrificed for a new one. The enters trigger's 2 damage also kills Bot2's Ornithopter (0/2) on turn 3.

